<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>rtok report</title>
<style>
body{font-family:sans-serif;max-width:60rem;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1rem;color:#222}
table{border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0}
th,td{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:.25rem .5rem;text-align:left}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:1rem;overflow-x:auto}
svg.chart{background:#fafafa;margin:1rem 0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>rtok report</h1>
<p>Window 2026-09-01 → 2026-10-01 (30d) · store /tmp/rtok.db</p>
<h2 id="window">Window</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>ledger</th><th>rows</th><th>covers</th></tr>
<tr><td>calls</td><td>0 of 0</td><td>window (30d)</td></tr>
<tr><td>measurements</td><td>0</td><td>whole ledger (no row times)</td></tr>
<tr><td>usage</td><td>0</td><td>whole ledger (no row times)</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>No rows in window.</strong> The store has no rows to report.</p>
<h2 id="savings">Savings</h2>
<p>Estimated tokens from <code>Measurement</code> rows only (est_before − est_after, net; floors, not context-token-turns).</p>
<p>No rows in window.</p>
<h2 id="calls">Calls</h2>
<p>Latency per surface, nearest-rank p50/p95 over the calls that recorded one.</p>
<p>No rows in window.</p>
<h2 id="cache">Cache</h2>
<p>Prompt-cache busts by cause, from the proxy's <code>usage</code> rows (whole ledger).</p>
<p>No rows in window.</p>
<h2 id="expand">Expand</h2>
<p>How often a live-zone pointer had to be expanded (<code>archive_decisions</code> rows, T5.4).</p>
<p>No rows in window.</p>
<h2 id="config">Config</h2>
<p>Every effective key with its origin — the <code>config show --sources</code> page.</p>
<table>
<tr><th>key</th><th>value</th><th>source</th></tr>
</table>
<p>0 keys.</p>
<h2 id="doctor">Doctor</h2>
<p>Live probes (the <code>rtok doctor</code> page), not store rows.</p>
<pre><code>hooks 0
hooks check none found
duplicate hooks none found
duplicate mcp servers none found
mcp
proxy 
proxy openai 
BASH_MAX_OUTPUT_LENGTH (unset)
autoCompactWindow (unset)
read-share no data
agents
</code></pre>
<h2 id="recommendations">Recommendations</h2>
<p>No recommendations.</p>
</body>
</html>
